Greetings,
It's been a month since the release of [b]Holy Shift[/b], during which time we've been busy developing our third project: [b]Chrono Bullet[/b]

But this patch shows that we are not abandoning [b]One Eleven[/b].
Today's patch is a preparation for the big patch, in which we will add [b]Henry's route[/b]. Expect a grand update soon, but in the meantime:

Changes:
- We removed the map [b][i](no one was using it anyway)[/i][/b];
- Fixed critical bugs;
- Improved texts;
- Added a couple of interesting dialogues;
- And everything was prepared to add a new route to the game.

Thanks you for believing in us :P

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42655055/2263b5d62f19b068c0368a8c814e08a55b6ba4d3.png[/img]
Greetings,

First, I would like to [b]clarify[/b] for everyone how the development of [b]One Eleven will proceed further.[/b]

[b]New chapters are separate stories.
[/b]These are stories that will clarify for you what really happened on the island. Therefore, I urge you to be patient. Please wait for it! Chapter 2 is coming [b](approximate release date is March)[/b].

And so that you don’t get bored yet, [b]a major patch is available[/b], as well as [b]18+ DLC[/b].
Let me remind you that we are [b]not a hentai novel[/b]. We are more of a [b]detective with erotic elements[/b] (and these are the elements you can see in the DLC).
[i][b]A good example of such works are movies: Basic Instinct (1992), Sin City (2005), Gone Girl (2014), etc.[/b][/i]

In addition, the [b]new patch[/b] will include:
[list]
[*] Updated sprites for Emilia;
[*] A new ending for Amanda;
[*] More convenient interface;
[*] New achievements;
[*] New menu descriptions;
[*] Approximately 50,000 new words and dialogues in the game;
[*] Some sprites and art have been redrawn.
[/list]

Corrections:
[list]
[*] Fixed a bug with resaving files;
[*] Fixed video bug for some video cards;
[*] Fixed a bug with music and sounds;
[*] At your request, we increased the number of save slots from 16 to 32;
[*] Voice acting bugs have been fixed;
[*] Typos corrected.
[/list]

