Greetings,

We have just published the latest update to "One Eleven".
This update patches the last errors that were still present in the game. More importantly, we have also added some design updates.
We fixed all failures:
- translation bugs fixed;
- steam achievements bugs fixed;
- gallery bugs fixed;
- text bugs fixed;
- interface improvements;
- theme settings added.

Many thanks for your hard work and helps.
This update has been tested extensively. However, if you happen to find any issues, please let us know.

Cheers, ViviLatvia.
